      <chord name="F"/><chord name="C"/>And <chord name="Dm"/><chord name="C"/>ne&#x27;er <chord name="F"/><chord name="Gm"/>from <chord name="F"/><chord name="C7"/>us <chord name="F"/>depart,<br/>
