      <chord name="F"/><chord name="Dm"/><chord name="Gm"/>To <chord name="C"/><chord name="F"/>Thee, <chord name="Dm"/><chord name="C"/>great <chord name="F"/><chord name="C7"/>One <chord name="F"/><chord name="C"/>in <chord name="F"/><chord name="C"/>Three,<br/>
